# =============================================================================
# dot_gitignore_global — 全局 Git 忽略 (chezmoi: -> ~/.gitignore_global)
# =============================================================================
# Description : 通过 dot_gitconfig core.excludesfile 全局生效；项目特定忽略
#               请放在仓库本地 .gitignore。分类见下，OS/编辑器/日志/构建等
# Usage       : chezmoi apply 部署后 `git config --get core.excludesfile`
# Author      : Payne
# =============================================================================
# Loaded via `core.excludesfile` in dot_gitconfig; applies to all repos.
# Keep project-specific ignores in repo-local .gitignore. Categories below.

# --- OS / backups ---
.DS_Store
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.bak

# --- Editors / IDEs ---
.vscode
.idea
*.iml

# --- Logs / LaTeX intermediates ---
*.aux
*.log
*.log.*

# --- Python / virtualenvs ---
*.venv
__pycache__/
.tox

# --- Node / caches ---
node_modules/
*.cache

# --- Build outputs（锚定仓库根目录，避免误伤子目录里正常入库的 dist/bin 等） ---
/dist/
/build/
/target/
# bin/ 已移除：无锚定的 bin/ 会把任何仓库 scripts/bin 目录无声排除，
# git add . 静默跳过而无警告；项目级忽略请写入各仓库自身 .gitignore

# --- Coding agent ---
**/.claude
**/.omc
**/.pi

# Note: `*.git` typo line removed (was ambiguous — likely *.orig/*.patch merge residue).
